"Prescription, Joo Daughter-in-law."

743
00:32:39.499 --> 00:32:43.294
"Herbal medicine to warm the uterus
and induce pregnancy."

744
00:32:43.378 --> 00:32:46.047
{\an8}She got the same prescription
