745
00:32:46.547 --> 00:32:48.883
{\an8}I guess she wanted a kid.

746
00:32:49.550 --> 00:32:52.261
{\an8}She was desperate to give birth to a son.

747
00:32:52.345 --> 00:32:54.389
{\an8}Look at all these peppers.

748
00:32:54.973 --> 00:32:56.557
