{\an8}I guess he must've had a hard life.

797
00:34:49.003 --> 00:34:50.171
{\an8}Is this his mom?

798
00:34:54.509 --> 00:34:55.802
{\an8}What's this?

799
00:34:55.885 --> 00:34:59.889
{\an8}I may not have done much schooling,
but even I can read "Top Secret."

800
00:35:03.392 --> 00:35:04.393
Joo Daughter-in-law?

801
