What the heck was he up to?

803
00:35:12.860 --> 00:35:14.237
{\an8}Jeez, what else is here?

804
00:35:14.320 --> 00:35:15.738
{\an8}KIM SWEETHEART'S NOTEBOOK IN A DRAWER

805
00:35:17.698 --> 00:35:18.616
{\an8}What's this?

806
00:35:19.283 --> 00:35:23.121
{\an8}The secret behind the umami flavor
